OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fscattered showers tonight, more so
OL,7,Ffurther west. These fading into the
OL,8,Fearly hours with temperatures dropping
OL,9,Finto the low single-figures under
OL,10,Fclear skies and easing winds. There
OL,11,Fmay be a touch of grass frost in
OL,12,Fsheltered areas.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FTomorrow will begin with
OL,15,Fsunny intervals and light winds, but
OL,16,Ffeeling autumnal in the cool
OL,17,Fnorthwesterly breeze. Cloud will
OL,18,Fthicken through the afternoon with
OL,19,Frain arriving by the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
