OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain,
OL,6,Fsometimes heavy, will clear on Friday
OL,7,Fleaving sunshine, scattered showers
OL,8,Fand strong winds. These showers
OL,9,Fcontinuing through Saturday, with
OL,10,Fwinds and showers easing into Sunday,
OL,11,Fleaving sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
